cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Clavix in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Clavix: Deterministic, Closed-Loop Voice-to-Action Automation of the Windows Desktop"
abstract: >-
  A local voice-to-action agent for Windows 11 that turns one spoken command into a
  schema-validated plan of typed actions, executes each step through the most deterministic
  route available (native operations, accessibility-tree grounding, then a coordinate
  fallback) and verifies it against operating-system state.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
license: MIT
